{"obsah":"<p>This Saturday a slightly more demanding weekend awaited us. Martin Šimůnek, Vlasta Kabeláč Čiháček and Matouš Balík headed north for a double exhibition in Horní Police, which was unusually located between the historic and the new bridge. Spectators could watch the action from the tents in front of the stage as well as from the pedestrian zone and the pavements on the bridges. The slightly complicated surface didn't faze the guys, and the exhibitions drew a large crowd.&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>In the break between shows the guys went to test a nearby bike park that could be a venue for Bikeskills.cz coaching courses. After returning and riding the second exhibition they set off for Staré Křečany, which is just a stone's throw from the German border.</p>\n\n<p>The festival in Křečany was in grand style. Concerts, security, a precisely set schedule. Our job was to fill the slot before one of the main bands. We rode just about everything we could fit in, including bigger jumps on the trailer and a Šluknov sandwich over volunteers :)</p>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F07%2FIMG_6173.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F07%2FIMG_6173.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-209617\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F07%2FIMG_6172.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F07%2FIMG_6172.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-209616\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"ht